00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.890
between the red ants that I see

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.330
and the black pants that I see.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.330
And so it seems like to me

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.880
a lot of people, when
they think about ants.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:06:00.230
They have two categories in their minds.

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:02.630
Red ants and black ants.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.740
In fact,

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:06.830
we ant biologists know ants
are incredibly diverse.

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:10.350
There are more than
10,000 different species

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.310
that we've identified

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:12.860
and there's probably many more.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.000
