variety of different things.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.083
Some of them are strict vegetarians.

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:24.233
Some of them are strict
carnivores and hunt their food.

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:29.100
Some of them actually will will
basically farm other insects

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:30.593
and exclusively eat,

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:32.920
eat what they provide.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:37.840
But the thing that all ants
basically have in common,

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:39.730
is that they live in colonies.

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:42.180
So they live in close
proximity with one another,

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.480
usually family groups

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:49.580
and they interact with
each other extensively.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:51.530
