00:33:41.157 --> 00:33:43.280
And that's just always
been fascinating to me.

00:33:43.280 --> 00:33:45.830
They're always involved
in, in behaviors together.

00:33:45.830 --> 00:33:50.830
They, the life cycle of a colony is,

00:33:51.160 --> 00:33:52.630
is so much more complex

00:33:52.630 --> 00:33:54.650
than the life cycle of an organism,

00:33:54.650 --> 00:33:56.150
a single individual basically.

00:33:57.231 --> 00:34:00.250
And ants are a great place
to study how that works

00:34:01.200 --> 00:34:02.033
and,

00:34:04.650 --> 00:34:06.033
