00:34:54.080 --> 00:34:59.080
So basically she sort of received
more nutrition basically.

00:34:59.407 --> 00:35:02.670
And so she was able to get
bigger because of that.

00:35:04.140 --> 00:35:06.321
And the other answer to that is sort of

00:35:06.321 --> 00:35:09.853
why do large individuals become Queens?

00:35:12.910 --> 00:35:17.167
And the answer is basically that in ants,

00:35:17.167 --> 00:35:19.940
if any individual reaches large body size

00:35:19.940 --> 00:35:24.200
they will also have the
capacity to lay lots of eggs.

00:35:24.200 --> 00:35:26.518
Whereas if they are at large,
that small body size, they

00:35:26.518 --> 00:35:28.540
they don't.

00:35:28.540 --> 00:35:31.723
They have much more limited
capacity to lay eggs.

